# Data license — CC0 1.0 Universal

Every synthetic example shipped in this repository (generated by
`jev_counterspeech/data.py`, and any copy under `data/`) is dedicated to the
public domain under **CC0 1.0 Universal**.

To the extent possible under law, meetr1912 has waived all copyright and related
or neighboring rights to this synthetic data. It is provided without warranty of
any kind.

Canonical license text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

## What this covers

- The generated corpus of `Example` records (text and metadata).
- No third-party dataset text is included. In particular, CONAN and HateXplain
  are **not** bundled; see `data/README.md` for why, and for how a user may opt
  in to a locally licensed sample via `PUBLIC_SAMPLES`.

## What this does not cover

- The source code of this project is licensed separately under the MIT License
  (`../LICENSE`).
- Any user-supplied sample added via `PUBLIC_SAMPLES` remains under its own
  license, which the user is responsible for honoring and attributing.
